      "standardized_narrative": "At 31 December 2022 the Syndicate's gross claims outstanding at the opening of the year were GBP 3,048.8m. During 2022 there was a net prior-year release of GBP 256.3m (c. 8.4% of opening gross reserves). The reported prior-year movement reflects the impact of the P&C UK 2019 & Prior YOA reinsurance-to-close transaction together with other movements in reserve estimates; this release was reported despite management also increasing loss estimates to reflect elevated economic inflation and geopolitical losses (Ukraine). The claims development triangle and notes are distorted by the RITC, and named catastrophe events in 2022 (Australian Floods and Hurricane Ian) materially affected the year's claims experience.",
